<title>USA: Democrats apparently win back Illinois House.</title>
<headline>Democrats apparently win back Illinois House.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Democrats appeared to have won back the Illinois House of Representatives from Republicans in Tuesday's statewide election.</p>
<p>News reports indicated the Democrats won the necessary six House seats to return them to control.</p>
<p>Republicans, who have controlled the Illinois Senate since 1992, took control of the House after the 1994 election.</p>
<p>--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647</p>
</text>
